<html><body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#181818;"><p>Dear {!Contact.FirstName},</p><p>We are writing to confirm that JCRC has received your final payment, recorded on {!Opportunity.Last_Payment_Date__c}. Your commitment is now paid in full.</p><table cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;"><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ddd;">Total commitment</td><td style="border:1px solid #ddd;">{!Opportunity.Amount}</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ddd;">Total paid to date</td><td style="border:1px solid #ddd;">{!Opportunity.npe01__Payments_Made__c}</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ddd;">Remaining balance</td><td style="border:1px solid #ddd;">{!Opportunity.npe01__Amount_Outstanding__c}</td></tr></table><p>Thank you for seeing this commitment through. Your generosity sustains our work on behalf of the community, and we are deeply grateful for your partnership.</p><p>With gratitude,<br/>The Development Team<br/>Jewish Community Relations Council of New York</p><p style="font-size:11px;color:#666;">[PLACEHOLDER - replace with approved client content. This is a payment NOTIFICATION, not a tax receipt: do not add tax-deduction or goods-and-services language here. JSI-125.]</p></body></html>
